 "source": "// Type parameters, variance, reified, where, star projection.\n\ninterface Box<out T>{\n    fun get():T // covariant producer\n}\n\ninterface Sink<in T>{\n    fun put(value:T)\n}\n\nfun <T> identity(value:T):T=value\n\ninline fun <reified T> isType(value:Any):Boolean{\n >) where T:Comparable<T>{\n    ireturn value is T // reified lets is work\n}\n\nfun <T> sortInPlace(items:MutableList<T>) where T:Comparable<T>{\n    items.sort()\n}\n\nfun star(box:Box<*>):Any?{\n    return box.get() // star projection\n}\n",
